@demoUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5090
@runId = replace-with-run-id
@workerId = replace-with-worker-id

### Demo backend liveness
GET {{demoUrl}}/health/live

### Demo backend readiness (includes Work-Flow)
GET {{demoUrl}}/health/ready

### Start a self-running demo
POST {{demoUrl}}/api/v1/demo/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobCount": 12,
  "workerCount": 3,
  "workDurationMs": 5000
}

### List runs known to this demo process
GET {{demoUrl}}/api/v1/demo/runs

### Read orchestration state
GET {{demoUrl}}/api/v1/demo/runs/{{runId}}

### Read the run plus durable scheduler jobs and workers
GET {{demoUrl}}/api/v1/demo/runs/{{runId}}/snapshot

### Watch this run's Work-Flow lifecycle events
GET {{demoUrl}}/api/v1/demo/runs/{{runId}}/events/stream?afterSequence=0
Accept: text/event-stream

### Simulate a worker crash
POST {{demoUrl}}/api/v1/demo/runs/{{runId}}/workers/{{workerId}}/kill

### Add a replacement worker
POST {{demoUrl}}/api/v1/demo/runs/{{runId}}/workers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 1
}
